OL,5,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FAfter a terrible accident on his
OL,7,     Fbike, a man has an excruciating
OL,8,     Ftear on his chin. A man is rushed
OL,9,     Fin, escorted by police with a
OL,10,     Fsuspected overdose. A cyclist has
OL,11,     Fbeen hit by a car.
OL,12,G2200 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,13,     FA window on to life-or-death
OL,14,     Fincidents in the fast-paced world
OL,15,     Fof the most specialised emergency
OL,16,     Ffirst responders. Joiner John (60)
OL,17,     Fsuddenly collapses from a cardiac
OL,18,     Farrest.
